Anonymouse inner class - used when we want to change the behavioure only once and we dont want to create for this a new class  

class A
{
  public void show()
  {
    System.out.prinln("IN show");
  }
}

class Main
{
  public static void main(String[] a)
  {
    A obj = new A() // means "i want to create an object of A , but i will add another implementation"
    {
      public void show()
      {
        System.out.println("IN new show ");
      }
    };
    obj.show();
    
  }
}
